WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.962
Welcome to Module 2. Python becomes much more useful once it can make decisions and repeat work automatically.

00:00:07.962 --> 00:00:13.077
Up to this point, most of our code has simply run from top to bottom.

00:00:13.077 --> 00:00:20.902
Now we’ll give Python rules: if something is true, do one thing; otherwise, do something else.

00:00:20.902 --> 00:00:26.032
We’ll also use loops so one block of code can process many values.

00:00:26.482 --> 00:00:34.294
These ideas are the foundation for tasks such as classifying records, counting cases, applying business rules,

00:00:34.294 --> 00:00:35.985
and summarizing a dataset.
